            "review_text": "Hannah P\nKingston-upon-Hull, United Kingdom67 contributions\n0\nWORST CAFE IN THE WORLD\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nWorst cafe not only in Vietnam, but the whole world. I had one of the worst experiences of my life. I waited 45 minutes for one smoothie and it didn’t come, the waiter did not apologise once and still wanted me to pay for it. He was rude, and I advise no one to come here ever.\nWritten February 23, 2023",
