            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Terrace",
            "review_text": "L32b\nWakefield, United Kingdom407 contributions\n0\nDreadful, Rude, Awful\nDec 2022 • Couples\nWe came here for a couple of drinks, and being British we had a game of cards on the terrace. The manager made the waitress come over to us and ‘stop gambling’… we were using UK coins to keep a tally. So we put the money away. Then the manager told the waitress again to tell us to stop all together as it wasn’t allowed and we were inciting gambling. Rubbish all round, rude staff and an absolute wimp of a manager. Never go.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2022",
