            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Terrace",
            "review_text": "Le Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nUnfriendly service that make customer felt unwelcome\nJun 2022\nWalk in around 10:30am expecting to have lunch and a cup of coffee with friend. Staffs took abit long to attend customer (that's not a big issue since I was waiting for my friend). Foods and drinks were good as I expected. But this particular waiter named Mr Cuong had made my experience here turn uncomfortable and felt unwelcome. As a regular customer of Saigontaste (master franchise of restaurants include Runam, Cafe Terrace, etc.), this was my first time experiencing such a bad service and also my first time visiting Cafe Terrace at Bitexco Tower. And I will never come back to this place!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2022",
