            "review_text": "DMH\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible service, abandon guests.\nApr 2021 • Couples\nI wanted to have lunch with my wife. Arrived early. Restaurant half filled. Sat down for 10 mins, nobody come. 3 staffs were chatting with each other behind the counter. Finally a guy acknowledge my existence. 3 mins later he brought me a stack of menu then left. 7 mins later, nobody bother to come. I don't think they will ever come, and I still only has 40 mins left. So I left. \n\nTerrible service, if I can call that a service. Used to dine at this often, but it has been going downhill for a while. Won't come back.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2021",
