            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Terrace",
            "review_text": "Another Bong Lady\nKolkata (Calcutta), India12 contributions\n1\nBeautiful Cafe and Good Food!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nFrom small stalls on the footpaths to lavish places with stunning decor and beautiful art, the cafe culture in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam has got everything covered when it comes to Cafeterias. No matter what your budget is, there’s a cafe for everyone.\n\nCafe Terrace beside the Bitexco Financial Tower happened to be one of the most beautiful Cafes we've come across during our Vietnam trip. The decor resembled a bird cage in a garden and every corner and furniture was unique in its own way.\nStunning Decor\nGood Coffee\nGood Ambience \nGood Music \nGood Service\nFree Wifi\n\nWhat else do you need to have a great evening.\n\nTips:-\na) Every cafes and restaurants in Vietnam has FREE wifi so if you want you can always ask for the Password.\nb) Vietnam cafes are known to add loads and loads of ice cubes so if you are not a super chilled drink/coffee lover make sure you explain that to them while ordering.\n\nFollow @anotherbonglady on Instagram for travel, food and fashion updates.\nRead more\nWritten April 28, 2019",
