            "review_text": "Bridstow\nPeterborough, United Kingdom1071 contributions\n0\nNice Place\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWe visited Cafe Terrace a couple of times; once with friends, once as a couple for drinks and cheese cake.\n\nThe cafe is in a nice place and service was very good.\n\nWe enjoyed both visits.\n\nThe first was especially entertaining when a man exited the building into the bright sunlight wearing his sunglasses without noticing the shallow pond. He step straight into it much to everyone’s surprise, especially him. Fair play to him - he passed it off by stepping out on the other side saying that he was off to buy some new shoes.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 15, 2019",
